.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xhtml/1.0
.# A list located in a quotation, as saved by the WYSIWYG editor: the XHTML parser wraps the blocks following the
.# first one in a Group located in the last quotation line, which must be rendered inside the quotation
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><body><blockquote><p>quotes format example<br/>next string</p><ul><li>letter</li><li>letter</li></ul><p>after</p></blockquote></body></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
> quotes format example
>
> next string
>
> * letter
> * letter
>
> after
